Honestly, some days feel harder than others to stay consistent, but today was a good one.

I started a Power BI guided Project by Tina Okonkwo and it reminded me why I started this journey in the first place.

 Didn't jump straight into building dashboards...
 We first talked about WHY dashboards exist, to help people make decisions, not just to look pretty. 

